ion":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:source_identity5-178","kind":"source_identity","person_id":"veu_ojl_33j","source_quote":"時常山人王輿合眾","reading":"尋為其黨所斬，與本卷反倫， 後和東萊王蕤謀冏的左衛王輿各據事件定位。","note":"尋為其黨所斬，與本卷反倫， 後和東萊王蕤謀冏的左衛王輿各據事件定位。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005","start_codepoint":178,"end_codepoint":186,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-ying-ws2650517"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005:m0182","surface":"王輿","start":182,"end":184,"person_id":"veu_ojl_33j","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005:m0201","surface":"輿","start":201,"end":202,"person_id":"veu_ojl_33j","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p005","text":"穎方恣其欲，而憚長沙王乂在內，遂與河間王顒表請誅後父羊玄之、左將軍皇甫商等，檄乂使就第。乃與顒將張方伐京都，以平原內史陸機為前鋒都督、前將軍、假節。穎次朝歌，每夜矛戟有光若火，其壘井中皆有龍象。進軍屯河南，阻清水為壘，造浮橋以通河北，以大木函盛石，沈之以系橋，名曰石鱉。陸機戰敗，死者甚眾，機又為孟玖所譖，穎收機斬之，夷其三族，語在《機傳》。於是進攻京城。時常山人王輿合眾萬餘，欲襲穎，會乂被執，其黨斬輿降。穎既入京師，復旋鎮於鄴，增封二十郡，拜丞相。河間王顒表穎宜為儲副，遂廢太子覃，立穎為皇太弟，丞相如故，制度一依魏武故事，乘輿服御皆遷於鄴。表罷宿衛兵屬相府，更以王官宿衛。僭侈日甚，有無君之心，委任孟玖等，大失眾望。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":157,"last_line":157,"raw_start":15827,"raw_end":16152,"raw_character_offsets":[15829,15830,15831,15832,15833,15834,15835,15836,15837,15838,15839,15840,15841,15842,15843,15844,15845,15846,15847,15848,15849,15850,15851,15852,15853,15854,15855,15856,15857,15858,15859,15860,15861,15862,15863,15864,15865,15866,15867,15868,15869,15870,15871,15872,15873,15874,15875,15876,15877,15878,15879,15880,15881,15882,15883,15884,15885,15886,15887,15888,15889,15890,15891,15892,15893,15894,15895,15896,15897,15898,15899,15900,15901,15902,15903,15904,15905,15906,15907,15908,15909,15910,15911,15912,15913,15914,15915,15916,15917,15918,15919,15920,15921,15922,15923,15924,15925,15926,15927,15928,15929,15930,15931,15932,15933,15934,15935,15936,15937,15938,15939,15940,15941,15942,15943,15944,15945,15946,15947,15948,15949,15950,15951,15952,15953,15954,15955,15956,15957,15958,15959,15960,15961,15962,15963,15964,15965,15966,15967,15968,15969,15970,15971,15972,15973,15974,15975,15976,15977,15978,15979,15980,15981,15982,15983,15984,15985,15986,15987,15988,15989,15990,15991,15992,15993,15994,15995,16006,16007,16010,16011,16012,16013,16014,16015,16016,16017,16018,16019,16020,16021,16022,16023,16024,16025,16026,16027,16028,16029,16030,16031,16032,16033,16034,16035,16036,16037,16038,16039,16040,16041,16042,16043,16044,16045,16046,16047,16048,16049,16050,16051,16052,16053,16054,16055,16056,16057,16058,16059,16060,16061,16062,16063,16064,16065,16066,16067,16068,16069,16070,16071,16072,16073,16074,16075,16076,16077,16078,16079,16080,16081,16082,16083,16084,16085,16086,16087,16088,16089,16090,16091,16092,16093,16094,16095,16096,16097,16098,16099,16100,16101,16102,16103,16104,16105,16106,16107,16108,16109,16110,16111,16112,16113,16114,16115,16116,16117,16118,16119,16120,16121,16122,16123,16124,16125,16126,16127,16128,16129,16130,16131,16132,16133,16134,16135,16136,16137,16138,16139,16140,16141,16